  "drivers": [],
  "summary": "Ilona Maher is a transcendent commercial force who has redefined the marketability landscape for female athletes. As a two-time Olympian and 2024 Paris Bronze medalist, she provides genuine athletic authority, but her true power lies in her extraordinary digital scale and cultural relevance. Boasting over 9.2 million combined followers across Instagram and TikTok, she is the most followed rugby player on Earth. Maher has forged a highly distinctive, authentic brand narrative centered on body positivity and the rejection of athletic aesthetic perfection (#BeastBeautyBrains), famously sporting red lipstick on the pitch. This has unlocked premium, crossover brand partnerships with elite corporations including Adidas, Paula's Choice, Secret, and L'Oréal, as well as mainstream entertainment success as a Dancing with the Stars runner-up and the subject of an upcoming Reese Witherspoon Hello Sunshine docuseries. While her competitive athletic trajectory is temporarily paused during a 2026 sabbatical, her commercial momentum and narrative durability remain exceptionally high, with her sights set on the Los Angeles 2028 Olympics.",
